# #188: Jaina shields out of a full walk (LB walk), right then left.
# a raises shield the frame it lets go of the stick; b lets go with no input.
# A walk is never faster than walk speed, so both brake by traction alone and
# stop on the same frame.
#! chat -dev quick hero jaina proudmoore
60 a press LB
60 a stick 1 0
60 b press LB
60 b stick 1 0
90 a release LB
90 a stick 0 0
90 a shield 1
90 b release LB
90 b stick 0 0
140 a shield 0
160 a press LB
160 a stick -1 0
160 b press LB
160 b stick -1 0
190 a release LB
190 a stick 0 0
190 a shield 1
190 b release LB
190 b stick 0 0
240 a shield 0
